.TH AVR\-ORG\-INSTALL\-ADD 1 "" "avr 0.5.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-org-install-add \- Add a GitHub or GitLab installation.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr org install add
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add a GitHub or GitLab installation.
.PP
GitHub is the default and retains the browser-based GitHub App flow.
.PP
For GitLab, create an expiring gitlab.com group access token with Reporter role, api, and read_repository. The token is read from a hidden prompt or stdin and is never accepted as a command-line value.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Examples:
    avr org install add
    avr org install add --platform gitlab --group-full-path acme/platform --project-selection all
    printf '%s\en' "$GITLAB_TOKEN" | avr org install add --platform gitlab \e
        --group-full-path acme/platform --project-selection selected \e
        --project-id 123 --access-token-stdin
.fi
.RE
.PP
With --json, GitHub emits the installations detected within --wait-seconds as a list and keeps progress messages on stderr; GitLab emits the registered installation, and the field list or jq filter must keep webhook_setup, which carries the one-time webhook secret.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
JSON FIELDS (GitHub)
    created_at, installation_id, organization_name, organization_slug,
    platform, platform_installation_id, platform_settings_url, state,
    target_id, target_name, target_type, configured_runner_count, degraded_runner_count
.fi
.RE
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
JSON FIELDS (GitLab)
    access_token_expires_on, access_token_invalid_at,
    access_token_last_validated_at, created_at, credential_kind,
    gitlab_namespace_full_path, gitlab_namespace_id, gitlab_project_ids,
    installation_id, organization_id, project_selection_mode, configured_runner_count,
    degraded_runner_count, selected_project_count, state, target_type,
    updated_at, webhook_secret_rotated_at, webhook_setup
.fi
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-\-platform\fR \fICHOICE\fR
Source platform to install. (choices: github, gitlab; default: github)
.TP
\fB\-\-group\-full\-path\fR \fITEXT\fR
GitLab group full path, such as acme/platform.
.TP
\fB\-\-project\-selection\fR \fICHOICE\fR
GitLab project selection mode. (choices: all, selected)
.TP
\fB\-\-project\-id\fR \fIINTEGER RANGE\fR
GitLab numeric project ID to select (repeatable, up to 1,000). (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-access\-token\-stdin\fR
Read the GitLab group access token from stdin instead of prompting.
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-browser\fR
Do not open browser automatically.
.TP
\fB\-\-wait\-seconds\fR \fIINTEGER\fR
Seconds to wait for detection. (default: 120)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
